- src/cron/stagger.ts: top-of-hour wildcard-hour detection
- src/cron/service/jobs-scheduling.ts: SHA256 first uint32 offset and
  bounded effective next/previous/inclusive cursor arithmetic
- src/cron/schedule.ts: UTC every anchor arithmetic
- src/cron/validate-timestamp.ts: one-minute / 365.25-day ten-year bounds
- src/cron/stagger.test.ts: default-detection expectation corpus copied in
  test/cron-schedule/stagger-corpus.json

Adaptations remove framework imports, caches and implicit wall-clock inputs.
R8's definition validation rejects invalid explicit widths instead of silently
coercing them. No cron parser, DST normalizer or host source is ported here.
decisions.ts is new Apache-2.0 policy code. The host's license is unchanged.
